{"id":"torrey:commandments-the-ten","source":"torrey","name":"Commandments, The Ten","slug":"commandments-the-ten","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Spoken by God — Ex 20:1; De 5:4,22.","refs":[["Exod",20,1,20,1],["Deut",5,4,5,4],["Deut",5,22,5,22]]},{"text":"Written by God — Ex 32:16; 34:1,28; De 4:13; 10:4.","refs":[["Exod",32,16,32,16],["Exod",34,1,34,1],["Exod",34,28,34,28],["Deut",4,13,4,13],["Deut",10,4,10,4]]},{"text":"Enumerated — Ex 20:3-17.","refs":[["Exod",20,3,20,17]]},{"text":"Summed up Christ — Mt 22:35-40.","refs":[["Matt",22,35,22,40]]},{"text":"Law of, is spiritual — See “Law of God”. Mt 5:28; Ro 7:14.","refs":[["Matt",5,28,5,28],["Rom",7,14,7,14]]}],"refCount":12}
